## Reproducibility checklist

A future operator probing the same SHA should be able to:

- [ ] Clone the canonical repo and `git checkout <sha>`
- [ ] Open every cited `file:line` and see the same code
- [ ] Resolve every documentation URL (or its archived snapshot)
- [ ] Find every cited issue/PR
- [ ] Distinguish in-probe sources from satellite supporting evidence
